<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Amount Basis</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">InvoiceAmount (Net, AUD) uses SAP VBRK.NETWR with S1/AB cancellations deducted. Negative cancellation rows are intentional; removing them overstates revenue.</Data></Cell></Row>
